"P2115117696" "<t=2 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=2><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateGray> Hello?<t=1 caption x= 0.5 y=0.3 d=1><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateGray> Are you there? Hello?<t=2 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=2><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor SlateGray> ...<t=3 caption x= 0.3 y=0.5 d=3><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateGray> You didn't say the code. So, is this you, Justin?<t=4 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateGray> Things must be fairly chaotic, given how your little organization was thrown into turmoil. <t=4 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateGray> It's funny, isn't it? It was easy getting them to turn on you when I revealed all your dirty little secrets, Justin.<t=4 caption x= 0.3 y=0.5 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateGray> I'll bid you a fond farewell for now. I wish I could see your face, knowing that I'm alive."

